WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.740
Wait! I said wait!

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:03.850
It's dangerous outside!

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.230
I am still leaving this place!

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.750
Why are you unhappy? 
It's perfectly safe here!

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.480
What is perfect here?

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:14.250
Here, we're controlled by the queen!

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.560
Or are you going to fight the queen with me?

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.990
It's futile. Have you forgotten about #72?

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.190
See? That's brainwashing!

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:28.040
Listen, you be careful, too.
Especially of the queen's—

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:30.880
Someone's coming.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.380
This is my chance. I'm leaving.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.380
W-Wait!

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:37.050
Don't go!

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:39.180
<i>I walked into something really intense.</i>

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.190
Heaven's Design Team

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.280
You have an unusual aura. 
Are you a traveler?

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:20.990
Uh, I guess so.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.360
I am sorry that you had to witness that.

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:25.860
Welcome to our queendom.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.670
Um, I feel like I shouldn't be here.

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:30.080
I interrupted you, didn't I?

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.760
No, I welcome you warmly.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:36.640
This is a perfect society, a paradise 
ruled by our perfect queen.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:42.020
But sometimes there are people 
who defect, like him.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:46.150
Common folk with few opportunities 
for an audience with the queen

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:48.270
lose their sense of reverence.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.020
It's sad.

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:53.830
Your queen must be amazing.

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:57.970
Once you meet our queen, you will understand 
how wonderful and magnificent she is.

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:00.020
If you would like, I can show you the way.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.590
Oh, #213!

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:06.910
Who's that with you?

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.840
Is that a traveler?!

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:12.690
He doesn't smell like the swarm, and he's 
wearing black, so he must be a traveler!

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.140
How cool!

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:15.530
H-Hello.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:18.770
Calm down, you lot. You can see that 
you're bothering him.

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:19.920
Get back to work.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.720
All right.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:27.000
Oh, #213. There's a message 
saying that new food was discovered.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:30.300
So tunnel #46, which was being expanded,
 is now a food store.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.250
I see. That's good news.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.300
I was just thinking that we 
should treat our guest properly.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:39.210
I'll go there now. Thank you.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:42.270
Goodbye, traveler!

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.160
<i>It's so big.</i>

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.090
<i>I could easily get lost here.</i>

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:59.080
Esteemed guest, what number 
did you have in your land?

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:01.510
You mean my name?

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.920
I don't have a number. 
My name is Shimoda.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.680
"Shimoda"? I see, your land uses 
different names than ours.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:12.190
Anyway, everybody here looks quite similar.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:15.220
It's hard to tell the girls and the boys apart.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.870
There is no such a distinction.

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:18.830
Unlike the queen and her few husbands,

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.190
we workers not sexually developed 
and are all equal.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:25.530
That's interesting. So if all 
the workers are young people,

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.230
what do the elderly do?

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:30.090
"Elderly"? What... is that?

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:35.330
Uh, um, like when you live long and get old?

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:40.330
Oh, I've heard of that! But we don't age.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.510
In this perfect society, 
there's no such thing as growing old.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.720
We don't get cancer, either.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.830
No cancer? That's amazing!

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.010
While only our queen can have children,

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:54.380
we are all more similar than mere siblings,
 and thus look nearly identical.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:56.440
Instead of clinging to individual happiness,

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.170
we prioritize the happiness 
of the entire land.

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:00.620
That's how we do things.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.720
This really could be a perfect society.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:05.960
This is the food store.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.330
Here? There's nothing here.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.870
<i>Wait, am I the food?!</i>

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.770
Is something wrong, Shimoda-dono?

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.070
Please, have some potato.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:29.760
P-P-Potato?

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:33.510
Yes, everything that's a 
different color is potato.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.080
Since this is a giant underground queendom,

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.910
we dig our tunnels into potatoes 
and use them as food.

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:42.020
So it's an edible tunnel.

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:45.340
As yesterday's potato was a clustering type,

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:49.030
<b>View of the Entire Queendom</b>

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.360
I thought that digging around the 
vicinity would lead to more of them.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.830
Fill the holes with dirt after you eat.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:55.200
That way it will regenerate, 
and we'll have more to eat.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.520
All right!

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:00.770
You're so knowledgeable.

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:03.970
No, I just pass on what 
I learned from #72.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.430
#72?

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:09.190
Yes, this is #72's notebook.

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:12.980
Prior to me, #72 was 
the one responsible

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:15.110
for developing the remote regions.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:18.820
I learned how to distinguish different 
types of potato, how to cultivate them,

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.260
and many other things 
by reading this notebook.

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:22.870
But at the end...

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:27.260
There was a sentence that read: 
"I am thinking of defying the queen."

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.260
Eek! Where's that person now?

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:32.540
The bloodstains tell the tale.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:35.290
Those who rebel against 
the queen are killed.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:40.010
Foolish #72... Why did 
you ever think to do that?

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:41.470
Let it be.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:45.720
There's no point in wondering 
about things like that.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.220
My queen!

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:50.590
I am honored that you 
would come out this far!

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:55.740
It's only natural for a queen 
to survey all of her queendom.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:07:00.480
Although, it would be a little troublesome 
if the queendom spread too far.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:04.600
Developer #213, it's been awhile.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:07.690
If you are too devoted to your work,
 I cannot give you this.

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:18.030
What an honor, to receive this 
directly from Her Highness's hand!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.620
Do visit sometimes, and don't go 
overboard with development.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.490
You are too kind to me.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.700
Are you a traveler?

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:28.930
Y-Yes!

00:07:28.930 --> 00:07:30.680
We rarely get guests.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.670
Do take in everything our land has to offer.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.950
Your queen is so elegant!

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:44.470
Isn't she? Our queen was not born a queen.

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:48.290
The strongest, most diligent 
worker becomes the queen.

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:52.660
Oh, so it's not hereditary succession, 
but a merit-based society.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:56.890
Yes, and she's always looking 
out for our health.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:59.050
This is a health supplement.

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:00.660
I am so grateful.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.040
Wow.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.750
If you would like, you can have this.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.890
I can get another one later.

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:08.770
Oh, thank you.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:12.230
I will show you the nursery next.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:12.970
Sure!

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:17.240
Packed...

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.900
Wh-Why are they laying under the babies?

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:23.270
Their duty is being the bed.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.600
Being the bed?!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.120
There are about three people
stacked up for each bed.

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:29.590
Isn't that a lot of weight for 
the ones on the bottom?

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:30.960
Can they breathe?

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:32.490
Probably not.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:37.230
But as we are perfect, we are 
fairly fine even without oxygen.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:38.500
Fairly...

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:41.490
<i>Is that perfection, though?</i>

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:43.280
Please hang in there!

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.720
Our queendom is underground, after all,

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:47.070
so there's not a lot of oxygen—

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.480
Wh-What's that?!

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:50.550
We're under attack.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.130
What? Oh, no!

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:56.130
Those are my siblings who are 
assigned to guard duty.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:58.420
We can just leave it to them,
 and we'll be fine.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.760
The guards must be strong, then.

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:01.550
No.

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:05.790
They're just going to block the entrance, 
so they'll be eaten by the enemy first.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:09.020
There's such a terrifying role?!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:13.000
As perfect beings, we don't feel much pain,

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.900
so if I were assigned to the guard class,
 I would go to be eaten.

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:18.360
That's terrible!

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:20.940
Are the classes that absolute?!

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:23.210
Even though you said becoming 
queen is based on merit?

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:27.400
Which means, in this land, someone
 like you could become queen as well!

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:32.170
I-I've never... That's... No...

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.900
See? That's brainwashing! 
Listen, you be careful, too.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.730
Especially of the queen's—

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.220
That must be it.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.170
Why did I never think of that?

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:41.410
All I cared about was being loyal.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.050
Is this brainwashing?

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.310
So you noticed.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:50.520
I gave you a supplement.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.200
Did you not take it?

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:54.470
I get it!

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:57.230
You were making us take that 
supplement at every opportunity.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.080
That's what you used to brainwash us.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:02.590
Since he worked in the far reaches,
 he rarely saw you.

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:04.960
Thus the effect on him wore off,
 and he left the queendom.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:10.070
Clever child. I've been 
waiting for this moment.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:17.550
I will defeat you and become queen!

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:21.420
I won't be controlled by you anymore!

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.320
#72?

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:43.130
Why do you have that number?!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.350
No... it can't be!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.320
#72!

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:54.830
I'll leave the rest to you, #213.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:58.230
#72!

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:04.140
I feel like I saw something 
I shouldn't have.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.850
Welcome back, Shimoda-kun.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:10.360
How did you like the "animals that 
create the perfect society"?

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:13.600
Well, it was perfect in many ways.

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.260
Yay!

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:17.350
What did you think of the new system?

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:20.550
I designed it so you can 
experience the animals' society

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.520
from the viewpoint of someone in it.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:27.630
The immersion was so deep that I'm 
exhausted, but it felt hyper realistic.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:29.470
That's great.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:31.780
You can see the inside of nests
 that you normally couldn't,

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:35.490
or understand the animals' social structure.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:38.630
Um, since I was seeing things 
from the animals' perspective,

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.580
everybody looked roughly like me,

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:43.870
but in reality they look different, right?

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:46.910
Their true size and appearance is this!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.770
<b>\h\h\h\h\h\hThe Queen
\h\h\h\h\h\hHer Husbands
Occasional Defector
\h\h\h\h\h\hGuards (Cannon Fodder)
\h\h\h\h\h\h Bed Duty\h\h\h\h\h\hWorkers</b>

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:50.260
Aren't they so smooth and cute?

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:54.130
Yes... So what's their enemy?

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:57.880
Snakes! But it's fine, because they 
seal the entrance to the nest

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:00.140
while their friends are being eaten!

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:02.040
God has spoken!

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.300
Accepted!

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.030
<b>Accepted</b>

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.030
<b>Naked Mole Rat</b>

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:08.310
Yay, it's done!

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:09.980
Let's go have a drink.

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:11.930
Yeah, time to drink!

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:13.890
Um, Pluto-san...

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:18.910
About this... What's in the queen's 
brainwashing supplement?

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:21.550
The queen's poop!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.830
I'm so glad I didn't take it!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:28.930
<b>The Illustrated Guide to Creatures That Really Exist</b>

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.840
The Illustrated Guide to Creatures 
That Really Exist!

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:31.380
Why are they naked?

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:35.240
Since they live in the warm soil,
 they don't need fur.

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.870
Without fur, they are less 
susceptible to parasites.

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:42.490
Their ears do have hair, 
so that dirt doesn't get in.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.660
Huh? Ears? Where are they?

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:45.940
Right here.

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:49.520
They don't have earlobes, as they 
could get caught in the tunnels.

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:52.010
Oh, so earlobes stick out too far?

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:56.590
That means the queen's tummy would get 
stuck in the tunnels when she's pregnant, too.

00:12:56.590 --> 00:13:01.080
Correct! That's why the queen actually 
gets longer when she's pregnant.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:04.140
Being longer is not such a 
detriment in a tight space.

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:07.230
She goes to that length 
to continue her patrols.

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:09.860
I thought she would at least
 rest when she's pregnant.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.480
Being queen doesn't sound too easy.

00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:17.960
The more I hear of her hardships, the more 
I want to go have a drink with her once.

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:28.000
Maybe I went overboard and made too much.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:32.800
I hope they'll like my gift 
of angel bean paste buns.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:39.010
Right! I have God's new order here, too!

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:41.640
Hel...oh?!

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:44.360
The time has come!

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:47.790
O beast, darker than night,
 heed my call!

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:52.090
Darkness, accept my life as payment.

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:56.270
Now, with my blood, 
this contract shall be sealed!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.860
You have to stop!

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:58.630
Hey, watch out!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.820
What's wrong? Is there an 
issue with this delivery?!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:05.020
Delivery? You were in the 
middle of a delivery?

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:09.060
Yes. See what you interrupting did?

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:12.610
He got stuck mid-transfer!

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:16.410
It's like a fax transmission error,
 but it's a huge demon.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:20.800
I am so sorry! It looked really bad, 
so I thought you were in danger.

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:25.670
Oh, it scared you, and you're 
an angel! Well done, me.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:29.040
This was your work, Chief Saturn?

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:32.560
Yes, I got an order from 
Hell for a familiar.

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:34.690
Oh, from Yokota-san.

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:39.550
The order was for an "animal that can 
communicate without using sound."

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:43.930
So I made a creature that is able to 
receive and send pheromones through the air.

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:47.370
The male goat can secrete volatile 
pheromones from its fur.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.560
Huh, pheromone communication, is it?

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:53.330
Those horns are antennae 
for receiving pheromones.

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:55.680
Th-They move.

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:57.740
Yes! They are antennae, after all.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:58.920
You're from the insect department.

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:02.840
The insect department has a lot of 
pheromone expertise, so I asked them for help.

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:06.560
The magic circle is the address, 
and the blood is the password!

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:11.420
Unlike us, raw tissue can't be 
transported with lightning.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:12.840
Ah, right.

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:17.280
Hm, it doesn't look like 
we can dislodge it easily.

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.340
What are we going to do?

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:20.460
What's this?

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:22.860
Oh, I brought those
 bean paste buns as a gift.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.810
Thank you! I love bean paste buns.
 Let's take a break.

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:28.800
Am I invited as well?

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:29.860
Of course.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.360
Thank you!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:36.010
It's filled with white bean paste!

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:39.210
So angels fill their buns 
with white bean paste.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:41.530
I always thought that 
bean paste buns went best with milk,

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:43.540
but these would go well 
with green tea, too.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:47.010
I also brought this new order.

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:49.640
Aw, we're on break.

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:53.510
Let me see what the client ordered now.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.670
An animal that rejuvenates!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.510
Another one that sounds annoying.

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:05.270
Um, I guess freeing animals from 
the curse of aging is difficult?

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:07.570
Aging is not a curse.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.020
If anything, it's a blessing.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:14.030
Yesterday, I saw an animal that 
doesn't age for the first time.

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:18.830
I always thought that animals had to age.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.210
There are no curses in life.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:25.530
Rather, every living thing is only made up 
of blessings that allow it to survive.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:30.250
Well, I suppose a little bit of our 
personal tastes are in there, too.

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:31.540
<i>A little?</i>

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:35.960
Aging is one method to ensure 
the survival of the species.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:39.550
It's only used by many animals 
because it's so effective.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:42.910
Besides, there are a lot 
of animals that don't age.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:44.570
Oh, really?

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.170
For instance, the urchin.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.690
This guy's lived for 200 years, 
but he's still healthy.

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:49.070
