00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:51.060
Yes!

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.790
We got it done right away!

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.120
All right, I'll go do the 
delivery for this now.

00:20:56.240 --> 00:21:01.240
Could we use this to reverse the demon lord 
back to a time when he wasn't stuck yet?

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:05.070
I totally forgot about that. 
Yeah, let's try that!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.580
Heave-ho! Hm, he's not budging.

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:17.080
Maybe he's stuck. Let's maximize the output.

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:18.840
Hey, don't touch that!

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.460
Wh-What just happened?

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:36.380
Are you all right?!

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:37.350
Please be okay!

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:41.330
Who?!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:43.880
Huh? What are you talking 
about, Shimoda-kun?

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:47.210
It's me. Well, that was a shock.

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:50.860
That mannerism... Are you Saturn-san?

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:52.010
You became young?

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:52.700
Huh?

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:54.160
What?

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:56.960
Does that mean the others did, too?

00:21:58.360 --> 00:22:00.250
They're not here. Why?

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:07.130
Oh, no, Shimoda-kun! The door that 
leads to Galapagos is open.

00:22:07.770 --> 00:22:11.080
The blast might have blown 
everyone to Galapagos.

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:14.250
What?!

